  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan studies Beast Calamity Immortal’s immortal killer move myriad beings assimilation transformation and names its four Immortal Gu. The core is rank eight Immortal Gu Adaptation, a transformation path Immortal Gu and the vital Gu of Beast Calamity Immortal. The other three Immortal Gu in the move are rank seven.",
        "chapters": [
          1690
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_beast_calamity_immortal",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_vital_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While Fang Yuan’s main body pursues other goals, heaven form stays in immemorial white heaven to deal with Beast Calamity Grotto-heaven and find the hiding spot of adaptation Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1692
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hiding-spot-search",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan notes that stealing adaptation Immortal Gu from that grotto-heaven would let him unleash myriad beings assimilation transformation for temporary great battle strength, but heaven form is still investigating and there is no time.",
        "chapters": [
          1693
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "theft-timing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Narration names the light yellow cloud sealing a dream realm as the myriad li adaptation formation of Reckless Savage’s true inheritance, a genuine rank eight transformation path formation with strong defense and Gu Immortal transport.",
        "chapters": [
          1872
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reckless-savage-inheritance-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_reckless_savage_true_inheritance",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Related formation detail sits on Myriad Li Adaptation Formation.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reckless-savage-inheritance-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_myriad_li_adaptation_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Reckless Savage Demon Venerable’s recorded voice names Internal Breathing Green Fish Transformation as the third of three immortal moves drawn from The Legends of Ren Zu stretch on pursuing freedom, and says that move uses adaptation Gu as the core. Besides being an otherworldly demon with hope of destroying fate Gu, an inheritor must possess at least one of attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu to trigger those killer moves above Embroidered Tower. The combination move incomplete freedom transformation has three cores: Attitude, Mutation, and Adaptation.",
        "chapters": [
          1956
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "green-fish-transformation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
          "move_internal_breathing_green_fish_transformation",
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "gu_fate_gu",
          "gu_attitude_gu",
          "gu_mutation_gu",
          "house_embroidered_tower",
          "evt_legend_attitude"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Feng Jiu Ge tells Fang Yuan that Heavenly Court’s Embroidered Tower holds three true inheritances left by Reckless Savage Demon Venerable, and that each requires a key: attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1963
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "embroidered-tower-keys",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_feng_jiu_ge",
          "fac_heavenly_court"
        ]
      }
    ]
